    [title] => Blockchain for Supply Chain Transparency
    [abstract] => "abstract": "This research investigates how blockchain technology can enhance supply chain management by providing transparency, reducing fraud, and improving efficiency.",
    [description] => v  "description": "This research investigates how blockchain technology can enhance supply chain management by providing transparency, reducing fraud, and improving efficiency. The study includes implementing a prototype system to track goods from origin to destination in real-time, utilizing distributed ledger technology to create immutable records of transactions throughout the supply chain process. Our implementation focuses on enhancing trust among stakeholders while reducing operational costs associated with verification and auditing.",
